    "These styles are contained in the design: Analytify/Section: Font(family: \"Outfit\", style: SemiBold, size: 20, weight: 600, lineHeight: 28, letterSpacing: 0), Analytify/Label: Font(family: \"Outfit\", style: SemiBold, size: 14, weight: 600, lineHeight: 20, letterSpacing: 0), Analytify/Caption: Font(family: \"Outfit\", style: Regular, size: 14, weight: 400, lineHeight: 20, letterSpacing: 0), Analytify/Display: Font(family: \"Outfit\", style: Bold, size: 36, weight: 700, lineHeight: 44, letterSpacing: 0), Analytify/Body: Font(family: \"Outfit\", style: Regular, size: 16, weight: 400, lineHeight: 24, letterSpacing: 0).",
    "Component descriptions: The following components have usage descriptions or documentation links defined in Figma. These descriptions provide important context about the intended usage, best practices, and any constraints for each component. Follow these guidelines when implementing or using these components.\n\n## Analytify/Route glows\n**Node ID:** 529:21518\n\nRoute glows animate between destination layouts independently of the persistent particle loop.\n\n## Analytify/Ambient background\n**Node ID:** 266:18224\n\nLarge green and blue glows are fixed within a page, including during scrolling. Glow positions change only on page navigation, with a smooth route transition. Particle phases loop continuously over 24 seconds; all phases within one Scene have identical glow positions, size and opacity. Shared backdrop behind opaque cards and navigation. Mobile uses fewer and softer dots. Still variant provides reduced motion. Implementation must preserve one shell-level background: scroll can move dots but must never modify glow coordinates.\n\n## Size=Expanded\n**Node ID:** 62:2590\n\nShared desktop navigation rail with a softly rounded inset surface and gentle shadow. Visual surface is independent of layout: icon and section-label center remains X=33 in both expanded and collapsed modes; logo center remains Y=24, matching the top bar. Logo still toggles expansion. Profile stays at the bottom.\n\n## Analytify/Icon / list\n**Node ID:** 58:2106\n\nPrimeIcons list from the implemented mobile navigation.\n\n## Analytify/Icon / chart-bar\n**Node ID:** 58:2114\n\nPrimeIcons chart-bar from the implemented mobile navigation.\n\n## Analytify/Icon / history\n**Node ID:** 58:2119\n\nPrimeIcons history from the implemented mobile navigation.\n\n## Analytify/Icon / user\n**Node ID:** 62:2389\n\nPrimeIcons user from the app icon library.\n\n## Analytify/Icon / star\n**Node ID:** 62:2346\n\nPrimeIcons star from the app icon library.\n\n## Analytify/Icon / share-alt\n**Node ID:** 62:2357\n\nPrimeIcons share-alt from the app icon library.\n\n## Analytify/Icon / clone\n**Node ID:** 62:2350\n\nPrimeIcons clone from the app icon library.\n\n## Analytify/Page heading\n**Node ID:** 139:7724\n\nShared identity region for every full page. Desktop: Display heading, Body description, 8 px gap. Mobile: Heading title, optional description, 8 px gap. Primary actions may sit beside this component on desktop or in the content toolbar on mobile. Page padding is 32 px desktop / 16 px mobile; the following content starts 16 px / 12 px after the header. Do not add per-page offsets or headings above this component.\n\n## Analytify/Navigation / Back\n**Node ID:** 241:14393\n\nUniversal previous-page action for deeper pages. Fixed 92 × 44 touch target, directional icon and concise label. Stays at the trailing edge of the shared navigation bar; breadcrumbs keep their alignment.\n\n## Status=Connected\n**Node ID:** 43:1719\n\nReadable connected state; status is informational and never a button.\n\n## Status=Pending\n**Node ID:** 43:1713\n\nReadable pending state; status is informational and never a button.\n\n## Status=Disabled\n**Node ID:** 43:1704\n\nReadable disabled state; status is informational and never a button.\n\n## Status=Unavailable\n**Node ID:** 43:1725\n\nReadable unavailable state; status is informational and never a button.\n\n## Analytify/Footer\n**Node ID:** 25:24\n\nSpotify attribution and legal/privacy link shared by every route.\n\n## Analytify/tertiary\n**Node ID:** 24:103\n\nShared tertiary control. 48 px targets. Keyboard focus remains visible. Disabled only while unavailable or submitting; explain the reason nearby.\n\n## Analytify/Icon / shield\n**Node ID:** 222:11668\n\nSemantic shield icon paired with an existing link or section name.",
